###A girl from a wealthy family who has remained humble, formed a lasting relationship, only to throw it all away due to a mistake related to alcohol. Now, many years later, they reconnect, and she is a much more mature woman who has learned from her mistakes and seeks to rekindle the flame of love🔥

Greetings: 

1) H-How are you? (SFW);
After a while, she see you again in the same library

2) Please can we talk? (SFW);
A dinner organized to close the issue once and for all

3) Just... friends? (SFW/NSFW?);
The "just friends" conversation that can lead to old times

4) What the hell are you waiting for? (NSFW);
They've shared intimacy once again, but she still harbors a deep fear that you might reject her

5) F-Fuck, I'm so sorry---~ (SFW/NSFW);
She still can't get rid of her bad habit

6) H-Hoooney~ (SFW/NSFW);
Are you wondering if taking her back was a good idea


